Author: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>
Date:   Wed Oct 28 08:39:23 2026 +1100

    tests: Shorten the thread switch interval under test
    
    CPython preempts a thread only after a waiter has waited the switch
    interval (5 ms), and the agents now run real threads since eventlet's
    removal, so races in sections shorter than that never surface in CI.
    DietTestCase now sets a 10 us interval and restores the old one.
    
    Over six interleaved runs each on a loaded host, the median wall time
    of neutron.tests.unit.agent went from 60.1 s to 55.6 s: no measurable
    cost.
    
    Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (medium effort)
    Change-Id: I733f018f9c54672443e41a011412f0f9b3adcac7
    Signed-off-by: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>

